<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">- Oyda New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">1 Ximotiyoosa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Phawuloosa Ximotiyoosas Xaafide Tiino Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Ximotiyoosa</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Ximo.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Phawuloosa Ximotiyoosas</para>
  <para style="mt2">Xaafide Tiino Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt1">Gele</para>
  <para style="ip">Ximotiyoosa ga7inttize, ammanze na7ay, eerats Isiya yelinttida (Ha. O. 16:1-3). E intta Ayhude; E aday mahi Girike asi. E Phawuloosara wolla oochchizayan Wonggele oocha Phawuloosa kale maaddize asi. Phawuloosa Ximotiyoosas xaafide tiino kiita hyaydzdzii aafe qofuntsana mintsii bi7ida.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ubbappa tiino kiita, woosa keetstsa denddide worddo timirttebaz mintsii ohine. Hyanna zaqqo timirttita Ayhude timirtteppa baggito, mahi Ayhude maaqqoosse asunts timirtteppa baggito aykkida. Yezin, «Hyanna benttize alamtta nagarara iitide gisho asi atotitsi denggodes dumma dumma maaqqide saza qofa erodes, fettii fettii katstsa ma7aanxi ashshodesin machcho ekkanxi woy azinii gelikaayzara ashshodes koshshane» yagaaze qofa baasa mahi denddida.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lam7intsa qoftta, woosa keetstsi ahize bazin goyno wogabaz tamaarssize timirttito, yinnii fana woosa keetstsa kaalitsizuntsana unttana maaddizuntsi akko gaar woga yessi yessades beezizako ohine.</para>
  <para style="ip">Wurssutsite, Ximotiyoosa Yesuus Kiristtoosas oochchize lo77o asi wayzi maaqqodes beezizako, mahi dumma dumma ammanze asuntsi kale ees yeze adetitsita akko yezako, Phawuloosa eza zoride zortto denggane.</para>
  <para style="iot">Aafe Qofuntsi</para>
  <para style="io1">Gele qofa <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TI 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xoozze keetstsi ahize asuntsis ingginttide ahe woga <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TI 1:3-3:16">1:3—3:16</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ximotiyoosas ingginttide timirtte <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TI 4:1-6:21">4:1—6:21</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1"/>Nuna ashshize Xoozze nu ufaytti naagize Kiristtoosa Yesuus kiita, Yesuus Kiristtoosa hawaare maaqqide, Phawuloosappa, <verse eid="1TI 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2"/>ammanora taas turii na7a maaqqide Ximotiyoosas.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 1:2">
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 16:1">Hawa. 16:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Xoozzeppa nu adayppan, nu Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosappa aadho keehatitsi, maarotitsin sarotitsi nees maaqqe.<verse eid="1TI 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Worddo timirtteppa naagintte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3"/>Taanii Maqedooniya hyanggitera nena hyadaridanni fana, fettii fettii asuntsi worddo timirtte tamaarssizanno kayodes ne Efesoone gam7ode gaar koyda. <verse eid="1TI 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4"/>Un maade baayze tosse ohen fa kochchi fayde ashshode fana oho. Yinnii fana yeze baz lalle medhdhane fattin ammanora oochchinttize Xoozze oocha maaddoos. <verse eid="1TI 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5"/>Hyay kiittizes aafe qoftta geeshi wozinappan, lo77o qofappa turii ammanoppa benttize siiqo. <verse eid="1TI 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6"/>Fettii fettii asuntsi hyanno ashshii, fatstsoosse lallego maaqqida. <verse eid="1TI 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7"/>Un Xoozze higge asttamaare maaqqodes koyane. Yezin un akko ohizako woy turtta akko yezakon eroos.<verse eid="1TI 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8"/>Asi beezize fana higgite maadinttiko higge lo77o maaqqizanno erane. <verse eid="1TI 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9"/>Fettii bazi qoppodes beezanna higge lo77o asuntsis medhinttikaaya. Yezin higge, higge mentsizuntsana, Xoozza goynoosuntsis, shemppo wodhizuntsana, nagaranchchuntsana, geeshshatitsi baayzuntsana, tununtsana, melle atto yezin fa intto woy adaya wodhizuntsana, <verse eid="1TI 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10"/>olale hyanttizuntsana, dhiiratsi dhiiratsara olale hyanttizuntsana, asi bayzizuntsana, worddo ohizuntsana, worddora caqqizuntsana, woy turii timirttera yellinttoosse akko oochan oochchizuntsis. <verse eid="1TI 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11"/>Turii timirtte benttize bonchchon anjjinttide Xoozza taanii awaajjode gaar taas hyadara inggide Wonggele gidda yene.<verse eid="1TI 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoozze maarotitsis Phawuloosa galatide galata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12"/>Taanii oochchize oochite taas wolqqa inggide nu Laatstse Kiristtoosa Yesuusa galatane. Tana fa oochitis shuumii yinna oochchitis beezane ga7i faydide gisho eza galatane. <verse eid="1TI 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13"/>Taanii hyannippa tiino eza cazhiza, eza kaallizuntsana bay7izayan waayitsiza maaqqikon taanii yinno erikaayzaran ammanikaayzara oochchide gisho Xoozii tana maarida. <verse eid="1TI 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14"/>Nu Laatstse fa aadho keehatitsito taalla afa gussii, yinna aadho keehatitsito ammanoran siiqo Kiristtoosa Yesuusa baggara taas inggida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Hawa. 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 9:4-5">9:4-5</ref></char></note><verse eid="1TI 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15"/>«Kiristtoosa Yesuusa nagaranchuntsana ashshodes hyanna alamite yi7ida» gaaze qaaltta ammaninttane asi ubba ekkodes beezane. Ubbappa aadhide nagaranchchize tana. <verse eid="1TI 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16"/>Yezin medhina de7o ekkodes eza ammanze asuntsis taanii aazize maaqqade gaar Yesuus Kiristtoosa gaama dandda7ida. Taas ubbappa aadhide nagaranchchizes Xoozii fa maarotitsito gaantsida. <verse eid="1TI 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17"/>Aafer benttoosses, fettii Xoozzes, hyayqqooses, medhina kaatizes, medhinappa medhina yellodes galatan bonchchon maaqqe. Amin77e.<verse eid="1TI 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18"/>Ximotiyoosa, ta na7ayo, zaga nebaz nabuntsi ohide qaalttilla afa eqqide hyanna kiita hyadartto nees inggane. Ne yinna qaaltto kaalliko lo77o ola olinttoda. <verse eid="1TI 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19"/>Ammanon lo77o qofa nees yezo. Fettuntsi fettuntsi fa wozintto dhabsi markkabe izhize baytsi dhabizanni fana ammanoppa dhabida. <verse eid="1TI 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20"/>Yinno hyanidunts gidda Hemeneyoosan Iskkinddire yene. Un tamaarii Xoozza cazhizanno ashshode fana taanii Xalahes unttana aatsii inggida.<verse eid="1TI 1:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Woosan goyno baz</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1"/>Ubbappa tiinii, Xooz goynora bonchcho kumide de7or woossodes, melles woossodesin galatodes beezanno taanii nena qofizane. <verse eid="1TI 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2"/>Nu turii ayyaana de7o geeshshatitsara Xoozza goynittera sarotitsara woppu ga7i yessade gaar kaatuntsisin shuumunts ubbuntsis woossote. <verse eid="1TI 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3"/>Yinnii gaar woossize nuna ashshize Xoozze tiino lo77on ufayssize baz. <verse eid="1TI 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4"/>Xoozii asi ubba attode fanan turtto erode fanan koyane. <verse eid="1TI 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5"/>Fettii Xoozii yene. Xoozappan asappa gidda maaqqii cimidhdhize fete yene; ezin asi maaqqide Kiristtoos Yesuusa. <verse eid="1TI 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6"/>Ezii asi ubba wozodes fana aatsii inggida. Xoozii fa wodite asuntsana ubba wozodes koyzanno beezize markkatitsita hyanno. <verse eid="1TI 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7"/>Xoozii tana Wonggeles asttamaaren hawaare mahi dooridanna yinnis. Taanii turo ohine; worddidhdhoos; ammanon turii qaala Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsana tamaarssode fana Xoozii tana shuumida.<verse eid="1TI 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8"/>Yinnii gisho, ubba bessa yeze dhiiratsuntsii, fana Xoozis dummuzii, kachchin lallen ashshii, fa kushito ude dentsii Xoozza woossode gaar koyane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 1:11">2 Ximo. 1:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="1TI 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9"/>Yinnii fanan maachuntsi fana ahizanno qonccize, bonchchoran wogara yeze afula ma77ades beezane. Un woga baayze omma datstsin, worqqara woy inqora, woy al77o afulara melluntsappa fana dummuzippe. <verse eid="1TI 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10"/>Yezin Xoozis goynane gaaze maachuntsi faas beezizanni fana lo77o baz oochcho.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:3">1 Phex. 3:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="1TI 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11"/>Maacha kiitinttera si77i ga7i tamaaro. <verse eid="1TI 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12"/>Taanii maacha tamaarssode fana woy dhiiratsalla adidhdhode fana baayzin si77i ga7i yessade fana koyane. <verse eid="1TI 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13"/>Addaama tiino medhinttida; suubappa Hewaana medhinttida. <verse eid="1TI 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14"/>Mahi cimintti Xoozze higge mentside maachito fattin Addaama baaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:7">Medho 2:7</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 2:21-22">21-22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TI 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15"/>Yezin maacha ammanora, siiqoran geeshshatitsara fana naagii yeziko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Fana naagii yeziko: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Woy E yelide na7untsi ammano, siiqon geeshshatitsara fana naagii yeziko.</char></note> na7a yelera attoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:1-6">Medho 3:1-6</ref></char></note><verse eid="1TI 2:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Woosa keetsi cimuntsana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1"/>Oonin, «Woosa keetstsi kaallitsize asi maaqqades koyiko lo77o baz amudhdhane» gaaze ohita turo. <verse eid="1TI 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2"/>Woosa keetstsi kaallitsize asi borinttoosaya, fettii machcha xalaala yezaya, wogara yezaya, fana naagizaya, beezanni fana oochchizaya, zaqqo mokkizaya, tamaarssodes dandda7izaya, <verse eid="1TI 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3"/>Matsinttoosaya, kacinttosaya, lalloosaya, bira yiqsinttosaya,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 1:6-9">Tito 1:6-9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TI 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4"/>E na7unts ees kiitinttizuntsanan bonchchizuntsana, fa keetsito ahodes dandda7izaya maaqqades beezane. <verse eid="1TI 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5"/>Fettii asi fa keetsito ahodes dandda7anxiko, Xoozze woosa keetsito wayzi ahodes dandda7e?<verse eid="1TI 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6"/>Uturara kumii, Xalahe Xoozze firddara gol7ide fana gol7aame fana, ammanor miinggikaayze asi maaqqodes beezoos. <verse eid="1TI 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7"/>Boreran Xalahe xike gelaame gaar ye atstse ammanoosse as kale lo77o markkatitsi yessades beezane.<verse eid="1TI 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Woosa keetstsa diyaqonatuntsana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8"/>Yinnii fana mahi woosa keetstsi daaqonatuntsi bonchchinttiduntsana, lam77i doona ohinttoosuntsana, gaama matstsize ushi uzhoosuntsana, bira yiqsinttoosuntsana, <verse eid="1TI 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9"/>ammano saza qofa geeshi wozinara naagizuntsana maaqqades beezane. <verse eid="1TI 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10"/>Un tiino fattaninttodes beezane; unttalla afa bore baayza maaqqiko, woosa keetstsa daaqone maaqqii oochcho.<verse eid="1TI 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11"/>Yinnii fanan, un maachuntsi bonchchinttiduntsana, zigiroosuntsana, wogara yezuntsana, ubba baza ammninttiduntsana maaqqades beezane.<verse eid="1TI 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12"/>Woosa keetstsa daaqonatuntsi fettii machcha xalaala yezuntsana maaqqo. Fa na7untsanan fa keetsito loytsii ahizuntsana maaqqades beezane. <verse eid="1TI 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13"/>Woosa keetstsa daaqone maaqqii, lo77o oocha oochchizuntsi, unttis damma bonchchon Kiristtoosa Yesuusa gidda yeze ammano baz ohodes mintsitimo denggoda.<verse eid="1TI 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Damma saza qofa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14"/>Taanii hyanna kiitto nees xaafittera, ellisii neego hyanggoda ga7i ufays gaddane. <verse eid="1TI 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15"/>Yezin taanii hyanggaanxi gam7iko, Xoozze keetstsa asuntsi wayzi yessades beezizako erode fana hyanno nees xaafida. De7o Xoozze keetsita turetitsis tuusin baasan. <verse eid="1TI 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16"/>Nu ammanttis saza qoftta so7e baytsi damma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Kiristtoosa ashor qonccida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">E turetitsito Geeshi Ayyaana markkidhida.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">Kiitanchchuntsis benttida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">E ka7itumtta worzha ubbas sabbakinttida.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">Alame yeze asunts ammanida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">bonchchor salo ekinttida.<verse eid="1TI 3:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Worddo asttamaaruntsana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1"/>Wurssutsi wode balitsize ayyaanan tuna ayyaana timirttito kaallii, fettii fettii asuntsi ammano kaddodanno Geeshi Ayyaana qonccizi ohida. <verse eid="1TI 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2"/>Yinnii fana timirtte un wozuntta doccin, asuntsana balitsize worddo asttamaaruntsappa ye7ine.<verse eid="1TI 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3"/>Yentsi fana yeze asuntsi ekken gelen kayane; mahi fettii fettii katstsa ma7aame fana ga7i kayane. Yezin ammanzuntsin turo erizuntsi Xoozza galatii woossii ma7ade fana Xoozii katstsa medhdhida. <verse eid="1TI 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4"/>Xoozze medhdhide ubba bazi lo77o. Xoozi galati ekkiko alla wodhdhize akkon baaya. <verse eid="1TI 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5"/>Ubba bazi Xoozze qaalaran woosara geeshi maaqqane.<verse eid="1TI 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristtoosas ammninttide aro maaqqe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6"/>Yinnii gisho, ne hyanna timirttito ammanzuntsana tamaarssiko, Kiristtoosa Yesuusa lo77o aro maaqqada. Ne kaallize lo77o timirttite qaala tamaariko diccoda. <verse eid="1TI 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7"/>Yezin maaden turii baayze oheppan cima maachunts tosseppa hyaako. Xoozza aazodes nena dusizo. <verse eid="1TI 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8"/>Asi fa galtto mintsodes oochchize oocha eeratsi wode maaddane. Yezin Xooz aaze dusizanna hyatten medhina de7o inggize ufayssi yeze gisho ubba bazis maaddane. <verse eid="1TI 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9"/>Hyay qaalize asi ubba ekkodes beezize turii qaala. <verse eid="1TI 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10"/>Nuunii as ubba, ubbappa aatstsii ammanzuntsana ashshize de7o Xoozza ufayssara naagize gisho, yinnis nuunii oochara labbanen butunttane.<verse eid="1TI 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11"/>Hyanna kiitito tamaarsso. <verse eid="1TI 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12"/>Ne yidhdho maaqqide gisho nena oonin borippe. Yezin ammanzuntsis neenii ohera, oochara, siiqora, ammanoran geeshshatitsaran aazize maaqqo. <verse eid="1TI 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13"/>Taanii yo7ode wontsis asuntsis Geeshi maxaafito nabbabera, sabbakeran tamaarssera minggo. <verse eid="1TI 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14"/>Tinbbite nees ohinttin, cimuntsi fa kushito neella afa gaddide wode ne ekkide, ne gidda yeze Geeshi Ayyaana imotitsi borippe.<verse eid="1TI 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15"/>Ne dichita asunts ubbas qonccode fana yinno mintsii qoppo; hyanno ubba wode oochcho. <verse eid="1TI 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16"/>Ne ommitisin ne timirttis naagintto. Ne yinno ubba wode oochchiko nenan nena si7izuntsana ashshoda.<verse eid="1TI 4:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Donzide maachchuntsi baz</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1"/>Cima ne aday fana bonchchop attin kaccippe. Yidhdhuntsana ne ishe fana mahi bo7o. <verse eid="1TI 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2"/>Maachi Cimuntsana ne inttii fana, wuduruntsana ne mishunts fana, folo geeshshatitsara aykko.<verse eid="1TI 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3"/>Azinii hyayqqide turii budanuntsana maaddii bonchcho. <verse eid="1TI 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4"/>Yezin budanttis na7untsi woy na7unts na7a yeziko, yentsi na7unts turii ayyaana yessi yezanno beesade fana yeliduntsanan, fa aftoon mayzayan maaddii kushe mahe tamaaro. Yinna Xooz ufayssize baz.<verse eid="1TI 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5"/>Fa faas yeze turii budantta Xoozzeppa maade denggodes ufayssara naagane. Awaran qamma Xoozii fana maaddode fana woosara minggane. <verse eid="1TI 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6"/>Yezin hyanna alamite lo77o yessi xalaala koyze budantta faxa yezara hyayqqidanno. <verse eid="1TI 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7"/>Oonin unttana boraame fana hyanna timirttito unttis inggo. <verse eid="1TI 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8"/>Yezin fa iginuntsis, ubbappa aatstsii fa kara asuntsis qoppoosse oonin fa ammantto kaddidaya; ammanoosse asappan aadhii iita.<verse eid="1TI 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9"/>Bere izipuntam kumikaayze budanttis suntsito mazggabe xaafippe. Mahi yinnilla afa iza fa azinzes ammaninttidanno maaqqodes beezane. <verse eid="1TI 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10"/>Na7untsana dichchera, zaqqo mokkera, geeshshuntsis tohe meeccera, madhidhide as maaddera, lo77o oocha ubbas fana aatsii inggidannon lo77o oochara erinttidanno maaqqades beezane.<verse eid="1TI 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11"/>Yezin na7atits maaqqide azinii baayzuntsi suntsito mazggabe xaafippe. Unttana azini gele gelo gaaze asho amo aykkize wode Kiristtoosa ashshoda. <verse eid="1TI 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12"/>Un tiino gelide qaaltto mentside gisho firddinttoda. <verse eid="1TI 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13"/>Yinnilla afa un oocha dhabin keetstsappa keetstsi wutoda. Wute xalaala baayzin zigirssin fana geltsoosse baza gelii beezoosse baz ohinttane. <verse eid="1TI 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14"/>Yinnii gisho, nu morkkuntsi nuulla afa ohinttize iita baz denggaame fana na7atits maaqqide azinii baayzuntsi azinii gelii, na7a yelii, fa keetsito ahode fana zorane. <verse eid="1TI 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15"/>Hyannippa zaga eertsi azinii baayzuntsi Xalahe kaallodes suub maaqqida.<verse eid="1TI 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16"/>Fettii ammanze maachita kara asunts gidda azinii baayzanna yeziko iza unttana maaddodes beezane. Yinnii gaar oochchiko, woosa keetsis toofo foollane. Ye wode woosa keetsita maade beezize turii azinii baayzuntsana maaddodes dandda7ine.<verse eid="1TI 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17"/>Woosa keetstsi loytsii yenggize cimuntsi, ubbappa aatsii, qaala sabbakera tamaarssera labbizuntsi dakko bonchcho ekkodes beezane. <verse eid="1TI 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18"/>Geeshi maxaafe, «Qoyda baha yedhdhize boora doona accife» Yinnii fana, «Oochchize fa damooze ekkodes beezane»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:4">Mahe 25:4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:10">Maato. 10:10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:7">Luqa. 10:7</ref></char></note>yagayda.<verse eid="1TI 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19"/>Lam77i woy hyaydzdzii markka baayzin, woosa keetstsi cima mootizebaz si7ippe. <verse eid="1TI 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20"/>Melluntsi zhashtode fana nagara oochchize oonan as ubba tiino seero.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:6">Mahe 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:15">19:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="1TI 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21"/>Neenii as sino bi7ikaayzara, fetaya fetayppa dummuzikaayzara hyanna kiitto naagode fana Xoozze, Laatstse Yesuusa Kiristtoosan doorinttide kiitanchchuntsi tiino ta nena zorane. <verse eid="1TI 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22"/>Oodellan afa ne kushito gaddii shuumodes ellisippe. Mellunts nagara gelippe; nena geeshshatitsara naago.<verse eid="1TI 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23"/>Neenii ubba wode hyargginttize gishon ne saza hyarggiti gisho hyaatsi xalaala uzhippe; eeratsi woyne uzho.<verse eid="1TI 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24"/>Fettii fettii asuntsi nagartta qoncce; bagguntsi nagartta unttana firddodes unttappa tiinii erinttane, yezin melluntsi nagartta suubappa gam7i qonccane. <verse eid="1TI 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25"/>Yinnii gaar, lo77o oochan qoncce; qonccanxi ixxikon genggodes dandda7oos.<verse eid="1TI 5:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Aruntsis ingginttide zore</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1"/>Xoozze suntsitan nu timirttita cazhinttaame fana arotitsa yezuntsi fana ahize laatstsuntsana bonchcho. <verse eid="1TI 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2"/>Ammanze laatstsuntsi yeze aruntsii, un laatstsuntsi unttis ishe maaqqize gisho unttana borippe. Un oochite maadinttize laatstsuntsi, ammanzuntsanan kadhinttiduntsana maaqqide gisho un tiinositippa aatsii oochchodes beezane.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:2">Neenii hyanno tamaarssodesin un oochchode gaar zorodes beezane.<verse eid="1TI 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Worddo timirtten turii durtumo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3"/>Oonin dumma timirtte tamaarssiko, nu Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosa turii qaalaran nu ammano timirttera giigoos. <verse eid="1TI 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4"/>Ye atstse uturara urqqinttane fattin akkon eroos. Unttis fettii qofalla afa lallodesin kacinttodes iita amotitsi yene. Yinnan qinaate, kachchi, cashshi, iita so7e, <verse eid="1TI 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5"/>yentses giigoose lalle kaalitsane. Mahi unttis iita wozina yene; turin dhabida; un Xooz ammanzanna duretitsis oge ga7i qoppane.<verse eid="1TI 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6"/>Yezin taas yezanna maaqqada gaaze asis Xooz goynizanna damma tirfe. <verse eid="1TI 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7"/>Nuunii hyanna alamite akkon ki7ikaaya; mahi iippa akkon ekkii qitoos. <verse eid="1TI 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8"/>Nuus katstsan ma7o yeziko yinna maaqqada. <verse eid="1TI 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9"/>Yezin durtumo koyzuntsi faatana giddan xiken gelane. Mahi unttana sulle dafizen dhabsize eeyatitsan qohize amotitsa gol7ane. <verse eid="1TI 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10"/>Miishe siiqo iitatitsi ubbas xapho. Fetay fetaya miishe amudhdhitera ammanoppa balinttii gaama azzanon madha gidda fana olida.<verse eid="1TI 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ximotiyoosas ingginttide zoren kiita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11"/>Yezin naate, Xoozze atstsayo, yinnippa hyaako. Xillotitsi, Xooz aaze, ammano, siiqo, dandda7an dalggatitsi kaallo. <verse eid="1TI 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12"/>Ammano ola loytsii olintto. Gaama asunts tiino nees markkidhide ne ammanttibaz, Xoozze nena yinnis xeegide medhina de7o aykko. <verse eid="1TI 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13"/>Ubba bazis de7o inggize Xoozze tiinon, Phenxe Philaaxoosa tiino lo77o markka markkidhide Kiristtoosa Yesuusa tiino ta nena kiittane. <verse eid="1TI 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14"/>Nu Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosa qonccode wontsis hyanno kiitto balinttikaayzara bore baayzin naago.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 18:37">Waha. 18:37</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TI 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15"/>Fa xalaala ubba ahize bonchcho Xoozze, kaatuntsi Kaatay, laatstsuntsi Laatstse, fa qoppide qammite Yesuus Kiristtoosa mahi kiittoda. <verse eid="1TI 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16"/>Fete E xalaala hyayqoosi. Ooden shiiqodes dandda7oosse foo7o yene. Ooden eza bi7ikaaya; mahi bo7odesin dandda7oos. Bonchchon medhina wolqqa ees maaqqe. Amin77e.<verse eid="1TI 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17"/>Hyanna alame duruntsi cer dhabize qolora uturaame, ceeqqaamen ufayssi gaddaame fana oho. Nuus koshshize baz gaantsi inggize nuna anjjize, dure Xoozze gidda ammaninttode fana unttana kiitto. <verse eid="1TI 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18"/>Nuunii lo77o oocha oochchode fana lo77o oochara duridhdhode fana, dalggan melluntsis gishizuntsana maaqqade fana kiitto. <verse eid="1TI 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19"/>Yinna unttis tiinos mintsii baasa maaqqade gisho ye wode un turii de7o akko aazizako eroda.<verse eid="1TI 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20"/>Ximotiyoosa, neenii fettii fettii asuntsi, «Eratitsi» baayze booza lalleppan maaddoose oheppa hyaako; nees ingginttide hyadarto naago. <verse eid="1TI 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21"/>Fete fete nuus eratitsi yene yaga7itera ammano ashshida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:21">Xoozze aadho keehatitsi yin ubbuntsara maaqqe.<verse eid="1TI 6:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6"/>
</usx>
